tensorflow/lite: model_builder::Tensor declared before the friend in Buffer (MSVC).

`friend class Tensor;` in model_builder::Buffer comes before model_builder::Tensor is declared, and the enclosing tflite
already has a Tensor of the schema (schema_generated.h). MSVC (19.50) binds the friend to tflite::Tensor, so the
constructor model_builder::Tensor(Buffer) cannot access Buffer::builder_ (C2248) and tflite does not build for
windows_x64. GCC and Clang declare a new class in model_builder, as the standard says. A forward declaration in
model_builder removes the ambiguity.

diff --git a/tensorflow/lite/core/model_building.h b/tensorflow/lite/core/model_building.h
index 8b9b87e..66a4b96 100644
--- a/tensorflow/lite/core/model_building.h
+++ b/tensorflow/lite/core/model_building.h
@@ -75,6 +75,8 @@ struct [[nodiscard]] AffineQuantization {
 
 using Quantization = std::variant<NoQuantization, AffineQuantization>;
 
+class Tensor;
+
